{
  "bodyHash": "WrQe68DJGx0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界生物學以令人興奮的方式，為你的世界帶來全新的刺激與危險！對抗兇猛的新生物，例如狡猾的終界幼獸、致命的墮落騎士，以及扭曲的凋零女巫——每個生物都帶來獨特的混亂。在冰雪森林中探索，被恐狼追獵，並運用貓頭鷹的力量翱翔於危險之上。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作傳送爆炸物、釀造詛咒藥水，並解鎖改變遊戲規則的附魔，例如靈魂綁定和驅逐術，來保護自己免受這些敵對新威脅的侵害。有了新生物、致命戰利品和令人費解的效果，你的世界每個角落都潛藏著可怕的事物——而每一次冒險都承諾著新的挑戰。準備好迎接一個危險不僅僅是注視著你……而是正在行動的世界。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌌 新生物</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧍‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界幼獸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：體型雖小，但兇猛無比！這些小終界使者攻擊力強大，而且喜歡追逐</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腦震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腦震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：爆炸時不會破壞方塊，而是將你傳送走！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，可用於製作特殊TNT變種。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：致命的不死戰士，有時騎乘邪惡坐騎！擊敗他們可獲得強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">墮落坐騎</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">騎乘的凶猛殭屍馬。治癒牠，你就能騎乘自己的黑暗駿馬！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙‍♀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：會施加凋零效果的邪惡女巫！擊敗她們，從</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">中釀造強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腐敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零貓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可愛？再想想。這些兇惡的貓咪保護著凋零女巫，攻擊迅速！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蟲群殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：終界使者與殭屍的混合體，攻擊時會傳送你！罕見掉落獨特附魔書。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐺 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">恐狼</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：冰雪森林變得更危險了！小心牠們發紅光的眼睛！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🦉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：友善的森林夥伴，會攻擊蜘蛛。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，用於釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上升藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 新物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎇 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：製作強大的傳送主題爆炸物！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腦震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：釀造強效</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腐敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，扭轉戰局！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可附加弓與弩的升級附魔，如快速裝填和多重射擊。由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：合成以製作自己的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終界幼獸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🥚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上升藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，翱翔天際！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 新附魔</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靈魂綁定</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：死亡時保留物品，但觸發時等級可能下降。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腐敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：對目標施加致命的凋零效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🚪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">驅逐術</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：受到攻擊時傳送攻擊者，模仿蟲群殭屍的詭計！</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 新藥水</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">位移</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：隨機傳送實體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腐敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：施加致命的凋零效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🤯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：施加噁心效果，混亂敵人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕊️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上升</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：賦予飄浮效果，讓你升入空中。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/6.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可透過模組選單直接在遊戲內進行設定（Fabric 需安裝</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作）。請注意，在舊版 Minecraft 中，亦需安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料夾，以</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">命名，取決於設定類型。並非所有類型都存在於每個模組中，如果有的話。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crazypants_mc_the_second\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CrazyPants</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 創作的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ender Zoo</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，我非常喜愛它，並迫切希望將它帶到現代版本的 Minecraft 以及新一代玩家面前。幾乎所有程式碼都是重新編寫的，這也意味著像是生物行為等部分將會與舊版模組有所不同。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 創作了所有這些令人驚豔的新材質。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/goldenagecombat/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/convenient-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/permanent-sponges\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/permanentsponges/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bartering-station\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/echo-chest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
